        <div class="pf-row"><span class="pf-name">4–5 innlegg/mnd · Facebook og Instagram</span><span class="pf-included">✓</span></div>
        <div class="pf-row"><span class="pf-name">Månedlig rapport</span><span class="pf-included">✓</span></div>
        <div class="pf-row"><span class="pf-name">Kvartalsvise møter</span><span class="pf-included">✓</span></div>
        <div class="pf-row"><span class="pf-name">E-postsupport, 48t responstid</span><span class="pf-included">✓</span></div>
